  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760366,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Fast 4 Gnomz: Nintendo 3DS Synopsis\n\nEmbark on a whimsical and fast-paced adventure in *2 Fast 4 Gnomz* for the Nintendo 3DS! Take on the role of Bumb, a brave gnome tasked with rescuing a princess and restoring peace to the magical kingdom of Gnomia. This action-platformer challenges you to navigate vibrant, platform-style levels filled with devious traps and hidden secrets.\n\nCollect socks scattered throughout the game to unlock bonuses and power-ups. Master unique abilities by manipulating time and movement to overcome obstacles and conquer increasingly difficult challenges. The 3DS version introduces \"The Nightmare,\" a post-game section featuring 45 levels and a unique star-collecting mechanic. Earn 80 stars across four worlds to unlock the final, challenging levels.\n\nFeaturing colorful graphics and a catchy soundtrack, *2 Fast 4 Gnomz* delivers a thrilling and accessible experience for players of all ages. Can you become the ultimate gnomish speedster and save the kingdom?"
    },
